---
description: Mandelbulb Explorer project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md and PLAN.md. This is a static Vite + TypeScript WebGL2
Mandelbulb explorer.

- Pin TypeScript to 6.x (typescript-eslint peers exclude 7).
- `npm run quality` must pass. eslint and stylelint use `--max-warnings=0`.
- Dead code: knip `--strict` plus dpdm for cycles. Do not add madge.
- No `any`, no non-null assertions, no silent catch, no fake render path.
- Magic numbers belong in `src/constants.ts`.
- HUD uses `textContent` only.
- Coverage thresholds are load-bearing; do not lower them to hide dead
  branches.
- README documents only commands that have been run. CHANGELOG records
  what landed. PLAN.md records decisions and gate proofs.
